    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-10T00:33:41Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Turn leftover cooked rice into a quick lunch: stir it in a pan with a splash of water and any spare vegetables until piping hot, using what’s already in the fridge.</div>
